#: ../../source/docs/throttle-boost.rst:5 2be2d5cb5ae0413cac539560b09494dc
msgid "Throttle Boost"
msgstr "油门增强"

#: ../../source/docs/throttle-boost.rst:7 c8a4de2ca4ac48ddbf0657a1af759641
msgid ""
"Even well tuned Multicopters can momentarily lose tight attitude control "
"with sudden, large throttle changes. Dips and Rolls can occur on \"punch-"
"outs\" or \"throttle chops\", especially on light vehicles with high thrust "
"to weight ratios."
msgstr ""
"即使调参良好的多旋翼，在突然进行大幅度油门变化时也可能暂时失去精确的姿态控制。在\"急推油门\"或\"急收油门\"时可能出现俯冲和横滚，在推重比较高的轻型飞行器上尤为明显。"

#: ../../source/docs/throttle-boost.rst:9 e5cee4c485044dfcb3ed32d1352a8a05
msgid ""
"In order to reduce this effect, the :ref:`ATC_THR_G_BOOST<ATC_THR_G_BOOST>` "
"parameter can be adjusted. Normally inactive at its default value of \"0\", "
"setting this to a non-zero number will provide PID gain multiplication "
"anytime the throttle is changed rapidly, either up or down. At the "
":ref:`ATC_THR_G_BOOST<ATC_THR_G_BOOST>` parameter's maximum value of one "
"(1), the  rate PIDs will be increased by a factor of 2 and the Angle PIDs "
"will be increased by a value of 4 during the time the throttle is being "
"rapidly changed. Lower values will result in lower gain multiplication."
msgstr ""
"为减少此效果，可以调整 :ref:`ATC_THR_G_BOOST<ATC_THR_G_BOOST>` "
"参数。该参数默认值为\"0\"，处于非激活状态。将其设置为非零值后，无论油门是快速增大还是减小，都会提供 PID 增益倍增。在 "
":ref:`ATC_THR_G_BOOST<ATC_THR_G_BOOST>` 参数最大值 1 时，油门快速变化期间速率 PID 将增加 2 倍，角度 "
"PID 将增加 4 倍。较小的值将产生较小的增益倍增。"

#: ../../source/docs/throttle-boost.rst:11 8b42ebdefe8242e3bd10390b4382a3de
msgid ""
"The less tightly tuned the vehicle is, the more it will require Throttle "
"Boost."
msgstr "飞行器调参越不紧凑，对油门增强的需求就越大。"
